    "None of the five setup scripts imports its runtime package",
    "oss2 reads __init__.py as text with regex; it does not import oss2",
    "sox setup.cfg attr reads literal version=1.5.0 statically through pinned setuptools StaticModule; no package __init__ execution is needed",
