    "crcmod broad-catch pure-Python fallback is rejected by required native ELF64 member and actual native import",
    "Built Requires-Dist must match reviewed source declarations, including inactive extras/markers",
    "Final pipeline never uploads source, wheel or venv bodies; only bounded receipts/logs"
